  "term": "Ativan",
  "definition": "Ativan is a brand name for lorazepam, a benzodiazepine that reduces nervous system activity. It is described as having anti-anxiety, anticonvulsant, anti-emetic, and sedative effects by strengthening the action of GABA in the central nervous system.",
